  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐竟然特地來見我，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我要用寶可夢對戰來展現\n這份感動與感謝！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D07ADF7136727957304F86898B6211FF0C00100001BE01000A6211898175285BF653EF59225C0D62304F865C5573FE000A90194EFD611F52D58207611F8B1DFF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不是找由紫小姐，\n而是向我搭話這點值得讚賞。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n那我們就開始對戰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D662F627E75317D2B5C0F59D0FF0C000A800C662F54116211642D8A7190199EDE503C5F978B9A8CDE300200100001BE00000A90A3621150115C31958B59CB5C0D62305427FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等等！妳們有兩個人的話，\n就由我來幫<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>的忙。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B497B49FF0159B3501167095169500B4EBA76848A71FF0C000A5C31753162114F865E6B001000020100000076845FD93002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好了的話，\n就直接開始寶可夢對戰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF01014F6059B36E965099597D4E8676848A71FF0C000A5C3176F463A5958B59CB5BF653EF59225C0D62305427FF01001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "開始吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "958B59CB5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟是不知所謂的狀況嘛。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳做好心理準備，\n就和MSBC的那兩個人搭話吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF662F4E0D77E562408B02768472C06CC1561B300200100001BE01000A7B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B3505A597D5FC374066E965099FF0C000A5C31548C004D005300420043768490A35169500B4EBA642D8A7154273002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓我們展現超Z隊的厲害\n給MSBC的那兩個人看吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B93621150115C5573FE8D85005A968A768453B25BB3000A7D66004D005300420043768490A35169500B4EBA770B5427FF01001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐，\n請和我對戰。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0FF0C000A8ACB548C62115C0D6230300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要和我一決勝負對吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B38981548C62114E006C7A52DD8CA05C0D5427300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來對戰吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F865C0D62305427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "竟然吊人胃口……\n我等著<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的正面答覆！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ADF7136540A4EBA80C353E320262026000A62117B49845700100003110000FF01014F6059B376846B6397627B548986FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這一邊有春紫在，\n也就是說勝利會屬於我們的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194E00908A670966257D2B5728FF0C000A4E5F5C31662F8AAA52DD522967035C6C65BC621150117684FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳對戰是注定好的！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳說不也是白費功夫。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C00100003110000FF01014F6059B35C0D6230662F6CE85B9A597D7684FF01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B38AAA4E0D4E5F662F767D8CBB529F592B300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好！就讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳看看我比\n由紫小姐還活躍的樣子。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597DFF015C318B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B3770B770B62116BD4000A75317D2B5C0F59D090846D3B8E8D76846A235B50300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要是做好對戰準備了，\n就和MSBC的那兩個人搭話吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B38981662F505A597D5C0D62306E9650994E86FF0C000A5C31548C004D005300420043768490A35169500B4EBA642D8A7154273002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "引導大家是我們名流的責任，\n皮可西！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F155C0E59275BB6662F62115011540D6D4176848CAC4EFBFF0C000A76AE53EF897FFF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "該拿出我們的絕招了！\n毒藻龍！超級進化然後大幹一場吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A7262FF51FA6211501176847D5562DB4E86FF01000A6BD285FB9F8DFF018D857D1A9032531671365F8C59275E794E0058345427FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寶石海星，\n讓她們瞧瞧我們的好舞步吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF677F36D77661FFF0C000A8B935979501177A777A7621150117684597D821E6B6554273002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哇～我們贏了，\n我們贏了呢，<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54C7FF5E621150118D0F4E86FF0C000A621150118D0F4E865462FF0C0010000201000000FF01001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐自然不在話下，\n玳蘿小姐的寶石海星動作也令人驚豔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D081EA71364E0D57288A714E0BFF0C000A73B3863F5C0F59D076845BF677F36D77661F52D54F5C4E5F4EE44EBA9A5A8C54FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "由紫小姐。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75317D2B5C0F59D0300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "會跳舞的人不只體幹穩定，\n而且擅長控制身體，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n因此具備格鬥技的素質。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n而訓練家本身的實力，\n會影響到搭檔寶可夢的動作。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67038DF3821E76844EBA4E0D53EA9AD45E797A695B9AFF0C000A800C4E1464C5957763A752368EAB9AD4FF0C00100001BE00000A56E06B6451775099683C9B25628076847D208CEA300200100001BE01000A800C8A137DF45BB6672C8EAB76845BE6529BFF0C000A67035F7197FF5230642D6A945BF653EF5922768452D54F5C300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "趁這個機會，由紫小姐也\n開始做舞蹈的特訓如何呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D819019500B6A5F6703FF0C75317D2B5C0F59D04E5F000A958B59CB505A821E8E48768472798A1359824F555462FF1F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "妳……妳明明就知道\n我沒有節奏感。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59B32026202659B3660E660E5C3177E59053000A62116C9267097BC0594F611F300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這樣的話，我來教妳！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90196A2376848A71FF0C62114F86655959B3FF01001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……謝謝。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "202620268B1D8B1D300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐，\n這是<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳獲勝的證明。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0FF0C000A9019662F00100003110000FF01014F6059B3737252DD76848B49660E300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>獲得了\n由紫裝扮洋裝！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000073725F974E86000A75317D2B88DD626E6D0B88DDFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>和由紫穿同一款？\n異次元密阿雷還真是無奇不有呢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000548C75317D2B7A7F540C4E006B3EFF1F000A75706B2151435BC6963F96F79084771F662F712159474E0D67095462FF01001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是異次元的由紫會在意\n自己沒有節奏感這件事，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n那現實的由紫是不是也一樣呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F75706B215143768475317D2B67035728610F000A81EA5DF16C9267097BC0594F611F90194EF64E8BFF0C00100001BE00000A90A373FE5BE6768475317D2B662F4E0D662F4E5F4E006A235462FF1F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就連社交舞……\n我都盡可能地避開了說。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C319023793E4EA4821E20262026000A621190FD76E153EF80FD5730907F958B4E868AAA300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我也懂得跳舞，\n如果由紫小姐願意的話，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n不如我來指導吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E5F61C25F978DF3821EFF0C000A5982679C75317D2B5C0F59D09858610F76848A71FF0C00100001BE00000A4E0D598262114F8663075C0E5427FF1F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    }
  ],
